{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/extras/JoinOurDiscord.png?t=1744888451\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/extras/Overview.png?t=1744888451\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deck\u00a0of\u00a0Memories\u00a0blends\u00a0a\u00a0deckbuilding\u00a0roguelite\u00a0with\u00a0a\u00a0touching\u00a0story\u00a0about\u00a0fading\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play\u00a0as\u00a0Joon,\u00a0a\u00a0lighthouse\u00a0keeper\u00a0looking\u00a0back\u00a0on\u00a0his\u00a0life\u00a0through\u00a0a\u00a0deck\u00a0of\u00a0cards\u2014a\u00a0handcrafted\u00a0diary\u00a0of\u00a0precious\u00a0moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/extras/cards_overview.gif?t=1744888451\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each\u00a0memory\u00a0unfolds\u00a0as\u00a0a\u00a0card\u00a0battle\u00a0on\u00a0a\u00a0beautiful\u00a0diorama.\u00a0Master\u00a0tactical\u00a0deckbuilding,\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">overcome\u00a0challenging\u00a0encounters,\u00a0and\u00a0piece\u00a0together\u00a0your\u00a0past.\u00a0Every\u00a0turn\u00a0lets\u00a0you\u00a0refine\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">and\u00a0upgrade\u00a0your\u00a0deck\u00a0through\u00a0a\u00a0deep\u00a0card\u00a0crafting\u00a0system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/extras/CraftyourOwnCards.png?t=1744888451\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start\u00a0each\u00a0run\u00a0with\u00a0a\u00a0handful\u00a0of\u00a0basic\u00a0cards\u00a0and\u00a0shape\u00a0them\u00a0into\u00a0a\u00a0unique,\u00a0powerful\u00a0deck.<br><br>Every\u00a0round,\u00a0you\u2019ll\u00a0receive\u00a0random\u00a0fragments\u00a0to\u00a0either\u00a0play\u00a0or\u00a0slot\u00a0into\u00a0cards,\u00a0combining\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">abilities\u00a0and\u00a0attributes.\u00a0Upgrade\u00a0your\u00a0cards\u00a0and\u00a0expand\u00a0your\u00a0fragment\u00a0pool\u00a0to\u00a0influence\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">what\u00a0you\u00a0draw.\u00a0Discover\u00a0rare\u00a0fragments\u00a0and\u00a0passive\u00a0powers\u00a0to\u00a0further\u00a0tailor\u00a0your\u00a0playstyle.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mastering\u00a0this\u00a0dynamic\u00a0system\u00a0will\u00a0put\u00a0your\u00a0strategy\u00a0skills\u00a0to\u00a0the\u00a0test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/extras/Steam_Video_Customization.gif?t=1744888451\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect\u00a0and\u00a0combine\u00a0synergistic\u00a0card\u00a0parts\u00a0to\u00a0unleash\u00a0game-changing\u00a0combos.<br><br>With\u00a0unprecedented\u00a0freedom\u00a0and\u00a0customization,\u00a0the\u00a0crafting\u00a0system\u00a0gives\u00a0you\u00a0complete\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">control\u00a0over\u00a0your\u00a0cards\u00a0and\u00a0abilities,\u00a0enabling\u00a0countless\u00a0strategies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/extras/Steam_Video_Diorama.gif?t=1744888451\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play\u00a0on\u00a0charming\u00a0diorama\u00a0boards\u00a0where\u00a0memories\u00a0come\u00a0alive\u00a0as\u00a0cards.\u00a0Immerse\u00a0yourself\u00a0in\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">a\u00a0variety\u00a0of\u00a0scenarios\u00a0and\u00a0random\u00a0events.\u00a0Easy\u00a0to\u00a0learn,\u00a0hard\u00a0to\u00a0master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/extras/Replayability.png?t=1744888451\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each\u00a0run\u00a0is\u00a0unique:\u00a0shape\u00a0your\u00a0deck\u00a0anew,\u00a0face\u00a0different\u00a0enemies\u00a0and\u00a0bosses,\u00a0and\u00a0explore\u00a0a\u00a0multitude\u00a0of\u00a0strategies\u00a0and\u00a0deck\u00a0archetypes.<br><br>Tackle\u00a0extra\u00a0challenges\u00a0designed\u00a0for\u00a0veteran\u00a0card\u00a0strategists\u00a0and\u00a0put\u00a0your\u00a0skills\u00a0to\u00a0the\u00a0test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/extras/Steam_Video_lighthouse.gif?t=1744888451\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Need\u00a0a\u00a0break?\u00a0Warm\u00a0up\u00a0by\u00a0the\u00a0fireplace\u00a0in\u00a0your\u00a0cozy,\u00a0rustic\u00a0lighthouse.\u00a0Tinker\u00a0with\u00a0cards\u00a0at\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">the\u00a0crafting\u00a0table,\u00a0catalog\u00a0your\u00a0collection\u00a0in\u00a0a\u00a0personal\u00a0album,\u00a0and\u00a0decorate\u00a0your\u00a0home.<br><br>As\u00a0you\u00a0progress,\u00a0unlock\u00a0new\u00a0card\u00a0parts,\u00a0crafting\u00a0tools,\u00a0and\u00a0curious\u00a0collectibles\u00a0for\u00a0your\u00a0safe\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">haven.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/extras/Wishlist_today.png?t=1744888451\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/extras/Zwischenornament_Bottom.png?t=1744888451\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/extras/CreatorsofNothing.png?t=1744888451\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3056570?t=1744888451","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056570/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744888451","capsule_image":"https://shared.aka